@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Semicolon-less script setup keeps console.log, the props and emit declarations and the IIFE in order (packages/compiler-sfc/__tests__/compileScript.spec.ts) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 defineEmits assigned to any name reads from __emit and setup destructures emit as __emit (packages/compiler-sfc/__tests__/compileScript/defineEmits.spec.ts) [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.3 A destructured defineProps inside a multi-variable declaration is removed and the other declarators stay (packages/compiler-sfc/__tests__/compileScript/definePropsDestructure.spec.ts) [AC-3]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Record the defineProps call and declarator, and the defineEmits declarator, on the context (packages/compiler-sfc/src/script/context.ts)
+- [ ] 2.2 Set the props call and declarator in processDefineProps and processWithDefaults (packages/compiler-sfc/src/script/defineProps.ts)
+- [ ] 2.3 Set the emits declarator in processDefineEmits (packages/compiler-sfc/src/script/defineEmits.ts)
+- [ ] 2.4 Rewrite the macro calls in place to __props, the rest proxy and __emit instead of hoisting assignments (packages/compiler-sfc/src/compileScript.ts)
+- [ ] 2.5 Update the snapshots (packages/compiler-sfc/__tests__/__snapshots__/compileScript.spec.ts.snap)
